    <string name="about_credits">Developed with ❤️ by Juan Quintero &amp; AI Assistant</string>
    <string name="about_description">A simple and elegant way to keep track of your thoughts, feelings, and more.\n\nDreamCode Notes is your personal digital sanctuary, where your ideas flourish and your privacy is protected. Designed for clarity and focus, it allows you to capture everything from fleeting inspirations to your most private reflections with ease and peace of mind. Every detail is crafted to help you organize your life without distractions, ensuring that your most important moments are always at your fingertips. Whether you are planning your next big project or just need a safe space for your daily journaling, DreamCode Notes is built to grow with you.</string>
    <string name="about_features">Key Features:\n• 📂 Effortless Category Organization\n• ⏰ Precise Reminders to keep you on track\n• 🔐 Secure Biometric Vault (Fingerprint/Face ID)\n• 📝 Rich Text Formatting &amp; Interactive Checklists\n• 📤 Advanced Note Sharing as Text or Branded Image\n• 🔍 Real-time Search and Filter System</string>
